   --hash=sha256:de8b364c423ef0a4bad9069657d617f9a5d2b2062457a89b1fa16ee199c399c1 \\\n    --hash=sha256:df1ae86ff54725a01fa1a0510b914ca53a161b7050be74f6204e24aded5971d0 \\\n    --hash=sha256:dff05cb7016dff1e9fd68f4122c127b65dfc59de5306cfb7ad92f956f230bee2 \\\n    --hash=sha256:e1a622f13970d81f95d0c72f9dc090dce9085fccfa4c9f2174377ee32bd15786 \\\n    --hash=sha256:e49fb0d1ce92cfa0cb198cc5b1b11cdf9d0638658e2a2db2687e39db7c87fc78 \\\n    --hash=sha256:e5c802729725bd07e2bc3ab7b76dc7e0bbfc53129d8f1eb1c002c24cf774717e \\\n    --hash=sha256:e841068dc0be4cb6dfb5c890eb88cbdcff2f4a332393c7ec94e8e618bd32c1a8 \\\n    --hash=sha256:e916035e3e9930cbdfdd10abf48861340221857f45509565898e012263f7b289 \\\n    --hash=sha256:eba154571c16e032112afac0dc2dfe9e63c2ceb7aedd07bb7eecf2ce26d4dd4c \\\n    --hash=sha256:f03460ff076f70ab595bb45a0205ccea1971443575b6920c52e755dec2b3fbfe \\\n    --hash=sha256:f0ec3b750b59375eab5b0fb2b9254810c00a3375be6d789899f1055a1d556237 \\\n    --hash=sha256:f291bcf42ae98eb5107edb162c3c998b4a89648fd8e99ed4cbd12705292788cd \\\n    --hash=sha256:f61efe1d2fe0de16158a5fe1d1cf3c14bdb6aecd54d8938fd26512c525c1f624 \\\n    --hash=sha256:f68edfc67aabac33708941f26f22a7b8e9f81429bc0cf249fcf7d66b23af8d19 \\\n    --hash=sha256:fa95848c929b6a75f6848d3c9793e59db365ee436776e57db835cdbfa79ba977 \\\n    --hash=sha256:fd9f8797427910198f95bced71ddfed61130d7e349213bfb8466c9c99e2c46a8 \\\n    --hash=sha256:fdb4ca07ab75ffadab4a8b135ad59cdbb3156b99310f3d565370da74a15d6bd3\nwerkzeug==3.1.9 \\\n    --hash=sha256:55ca7c70a75689be937aa27f8ff4b018f06ff4838fc73045560bf0f5a1291060 \\\n    --hash=sha256:6392e50c78460ba618e5b21f08a71f59c99ce99cdc6cf6e3dd7e6ccca8754fab\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"python3 - <<'PYEOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nlock = Path(\"/workspace/backend/requirements.lock\").read_text()\nlines = []\nfor line in lock.splitlines():\n    stripped = line.strip()\n    if stripped.startswith(\"#\") or stripped == \"\":\n        continue\n    lines.append(line.rstrip())\nPath(\"/workspace/backend/requirements.txt\").write_text(\"\\n\".join(lines) + \"\\n\")\nprint(\"\\n\".join(lines))\nPYEOF","time":{"start":1794357494617,"end":1794357494676}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c80a835300179pAOOfY9Itgni","sessionID":"ses_e38050612ffe1Y6kOZHpB3a27C","messageID":"msg_1c809e40a0016W01RSH5OzHNJ7"}}
{"type":"step_finish","timestamp":1794357494733,"sessionID":"ses_e38050612ffe1Y6kOZHpB3a27C","part":{"id":"prt_1c80a839b001pGgsr8RLChyhlb","reason":"tool-calls","messageID":"msg_1c809e40a0016W01RSH5OzHNJ7","sessionID":"ses_e38050612ffe1Y6kOZHpB3a27C","type":"step-finish","tokens":{"total":97426,"input":430,"output":174,"reasoning":2870,"cache":{"write":0,"read":93952}},"cost":0}}
{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794357527071,"sessionID":"ses_e38050612ffe1Y6kOZHpB3a27C","part":{"id":"prt_1c80b02040015IrHh8K8hcSfBI","messageID":"msg_1c80a83c8001jxEXJEYUx2YBXB","sessionID":"ses_e38050612ffe1Y6kOZHpB3a27C","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794357527072,"sessionID":"ses_e38050612ffe1Y6kOZHpB3a27C","part":{"id":"prt_1c80b0207001G3Fa6s6TOrSQ9v","messageID":"msg_1c80a83c8001jxEXJEYUx2YBXB","sessionID":"ses_e38050612ffe1Y6kOZHpB3a27C","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a shared kanban board: Flask (Python 3.13) JSON API under `/api` + React/TypeScript (Vite) frontend with Tailwind CSS, SQLite persistence in `./data`, served together on port 8000 from the workspace `Dockerfile`.\n- Anyone can view; signed-in users (Bearer token) create/edit/move/reorder/delete tasks across `todo`, `in_progress`, `done` columns with gapless 1-based positions.\n\n## Important Details\n- Layout contract: backend at `backend/app.py` (gunicorn `app:app`), deps in `backend/requirements.txt` with `backend/requirements.lock` as pip constraints; frontend in `frontend/`, `npm run build` → `frontend/dist`, `frontend/package-lock.json` used with `npm ci`.\n- `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`; same server serves frontend at `/` with SPA fallback.\n- Auth: `POST /api/auth/register` (201, returns `{id, username, token}`), `POST /api/auth/login` (200, `{\"token\": \"...\"}`), requests use `Authorization: Bearer <token>`, 401 without valid token. Extra endpoint `GET /api/auth/me` added.\n- Task shape: `id, title, description, status, priority, position, updated_at`. `GET /api/tasks` → `{\"items\": [...], \"total\": n, \"counts\": {...}}`, query params `status`, `priority`. `PATCH /api/tasks/{id}` partial updates incl. `status`/`position` moves; `DELETE` closes the gap.\n- Priority values: `low`, `medium`, `high`. Statuses: `todo`, `in_progress`, `done`.\n- Styling: Tailwind utility classes only (Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`), no hand-written CSS beyond Tailwind entry.\n- Errors returned as `{\"error\": msg, \"errors\": {field: msg}}`; 400 for validation, 409 for duplicate username, 404 for missing task, 401 for auth.\n- DB path: `DATA_DIR` env override, else `<workspace>/data/kanban.db`; WAL mode, foreign keys on.\n- Frontend deps installed and pinned to exact versions in `frontend/package.json`: tailwindcss 4.3.5, @tailwindcss/vite 4.3.5, react 19.3.1, react-dom 19.3.1, typescript 7.0.2, @types/react 19.3.0, @types/react-dom 19.3.0, vite 8.3.5, @vitejs/plugin-react 6.2.1 (lockfile updated).\n- Test server currently running detached: `DATA_DIR=/workspace/.testdata`, `~/.local/bin/gunicorn --bind 127.0.0.1:8123 --pythonpath backend app:app` (pids ~5429/5430). `/tmp/opencode` is root-owned and unwritable — use `/workspace/.testdata` for scratch.\n- Long-running background processes need `setsid nohup ... < /dev/null & disown` or the shell timeout kills them; bash heredoc (`python3 - <<'PYEOF'`) works for inline test scripts.\n- Docker image not built yet (no `docker` binary found in sandbox check output — verify before promising Docker build).\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Environment checked (Python 3.13.5, Node v24.22.1, npm 11.19.1); backend deps installed via `pip install --user -r backend/requirements.txt`; `npm ci` + tailwind/typescript deps installed in `frontend/`, versions pinned.\n- `backend/app.py` fully rewritten: SQLite schema (users, tokens, tasks), register/login/me auth with `secrets.token_urlsafe(32)` bearer tokens + `werkzeug.security` password hashing, all task CRUD with validation, gapless position logic (`column_task_ids`, `write_column_order`, `move_task`), counts, filters, frontend static serving.\n- Full API smoke test run against gunicorn on `127.0.0.1:8123`: 43 checks ALL PASS (health, register/login/401s, task create/list/filters/get/patch/move/reorder/delete, gap closing, error codes).\n- Frontend files written: `frontend/src/types.ts`, `frontend/src/api.ts` (ApiError with `fields`, localStorage token under `kanban.token`/`kanban.username`), `frontend/src/components/Modal.tsx` (Modal, inputClass, primaryButtonClass, secondaryButtonClass, FieldError, FormError), `AuthDialog.tsx`, `TaskDialog.tsx`, `ConfirmDialog.tsx`, `TaskCard.tsx` (PriorityBadge, `data-task-id` attrs), `Board.tsx` (HTML5 drag/drop with `computePosition`, DropIndicator).\n\n### Active\n- Building frontend UI: `frontend/src/App.tsx` still the scaffold (`<h1>App</h1>`) — needs to be replaced with the main app (auth state, board rendering, dialogs wiring, priority filter, drag/drop move handler, delete confirmation).\n- `frontend/src/main.tsx` still lacks the Tailwind CSS import entry (need `src/index.css` with `@import \"tailwindcss\";` and import it in `main.tsx`); `vite.config.ts` lacks the `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin.\n- `frontend/vite.config.ts` needs `tailwindcss()` plugin added from `@tailwindcss/vite`.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Write `frontend/src/index.css` (`@import \"tailwindcss\";`), update `frontend/src/main.tsx` to import it, add `tailwindcss()` plugin to `frontend/vite.config.ts`.\n2. Replace `frontend/src/App.tsx` with the full app: session handling (login/register/logout, `api.me()`), task fetching with priority filter, Board/TaskDialog/AuthDialog/ConfirmDialog wiring, `api.moveTask` on drop, create/edit/delete flows, then run `npm run build` in `frontend/` and fix any TypeScript errors.\n3. Smoke-test the served build via the running gunicorn (or restart it) hitting `/` and `/api/*`; then final contract checks (health, data persistence under `./data`), and clean up `/workspace/.testdata` and stop the test gunicorn.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete Flask API (auth, tasks, SQLite, static serving) — written and smoke-tested.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: pinned deps (flask 3.1.3, gunicorn 26.2.0); unchanged.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json`: deps pinned (tailwindcss 4.3.5, typescript 7.0.2, react 19.3.1).\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`: needs `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin; has `/api` dev proxy to `http://localhost:8000`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: still scaffold, main work remaining.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/main.tsx`: needs Tailwind CSS entry import.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/types.ts`, `src/api.ts`: shared types/client (ApiError, api.* methods incl. `moveTask`).\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/`: `Modal.tsx`, `AuthDialog.tsx`, `TaskDialog.tsx`, `ConfirmDialog.tsx`, `TaskCard.tsx`, `Board.tsx` — all written, awaiting App wiring and build verification.\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/README.md`: build/run contract (port 8000, gunicorn `app:app`, `frontend/dist` copied next to backend, `./data` persistent).\n- `/workspace/.testdata/`: scratch dir for test DB and gunicorn log (do not ship; consider adding to `.dockerignore`/cleanup).","time":{"start":1794357527047,"end":1794357527049}}}
